{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092850/extras/6035746d58ca95fb99c05c21de8dde77.poster.avif?t=1762056866\" width=1170 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092850/extras/6035746d58ca95fb99c05c21de8dde77.webm?t=1762056866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092850/extras/6035746d58ca95fb99c05c21de8dde77.mp4?t=1762056866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092850/extras/ba3953bec5c5664cc3d59cae481ff1a8.poster.avif?t=1762056866\" width=1170 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092850/extras/ba3953bec5c5664cc3d59cae481ff1a8.webm?t=1762056866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092850/extras/ba3953bec5c5664cc3d59cae481ff1a8.mp4?t=1762056866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, a big hug to all our player friends, and thank you for your support. Many players have been saying, &quot;This is clearly an adults-only game, so why is there no 'adult content'?&quot; The author would like to explain here:<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092850/extras/9844a0a403719c7cdce5ae03de9f54ef.avif?t=1762056866\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s not that the author is deliberately causing trouble, but the platform won\u2019t approve it\u2014direct adult content would lead to a ban. What we\u2019re making is a game, and the gameplay requirements must outweigh the adult content to have a chance of getting approved.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092850/extras/6794d336700793123350b95542a7f7f4.avif?t=1762056866\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please hang in there, players. When Emperor Ling of Han recruits Zhang Ning and trains her to level 20, he will establish the &quot;Buliang Guard Station,&quot; triggering the follow-up mission with Diaochan at the Autumn Moon Pavilion.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092850/extras/8d8e2bcf126243ff8968bc7cabb7bbad.avif?t=1762056866\" width=1560 height=882 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you can defeat the black-clad night patrol boss at Suzaku Street, be warned\u2014his &quot;Three Moonlight Strikes&quot; will make you cry out in pain...<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092850/extras/28224341cfd28c4e420e63d268808acd.avif?t=1762056866\" width=1560 height=876 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, if you can defeat him through sheer skill, the system will reward you with a &quot;Mirror of Time and Space.&quot; Perhaps the mirror holds the answers you seek...<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092850/extras/d0cea2ea541cd8461f411db50c8fe2fa.avif?t=1762056866\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, and if you defeat Empress Dowager Dong in the Yongle Palace, you can obtain a &quot;Night Pearl,&quot; which will help you quickly gather enough betrothal gifts for Zhang Ning.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092850/extras/7ae330506bfeb5ae60953c6270f61efe.avif?t=1762056866\" width=1560 height=874 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take on the role of an ancient emperor, traveling back and forth between the Golden Luang Hall, Zhonghe Hall, Imperial Garden, Qintian Temple, and the imperial harem.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092850/extras/06baa47bd850c8dc0e152eddef4b480f.avif?t=1762056866\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Golden Luang Hall: Every once in a while, the ministers of the Golden Luang Hall will randomly generate government bubbles. Players can click on the bubbles to choose to handle government affairs. Each government affairs has two different choices, obtaining national luck value or monetary amount. The level determines the number of rewards.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092850/extras/72dad5ba3413801db43b3c1b8dda3dd3.avif?t=1762056866\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Zhonghe Hall: Go to Zhonghe Hall and interact with NPC Grand Academician. There are four interactive options, namely: conversation, gift giving, challenge, and plot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Conversation: Minor increase in loyalty, no consumption</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Gift giving: significantly increases loyalty and consumes money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Challenge: Trigger NPC battles, winning can earn national luck points and money, and increase NPC level. Failure remains unchanged.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Plot: Trigger the exclusive storyline for the Grand Master.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092850/extras/1ee2ac67107d75b7b3dae1c8af978876.avif?t=1762056866\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. NPC battles: The NPC level determines the combat attributes, which include &quot;attack, defense, life, critical strike, and speed&quot;. Battle losses are calculated in seconds based on the speed of both the enemy and us, with an initial settlement of every 5 seconds. During the battle, bubbles will be randomly generated, and clicking on them can change the situation of the battle. For example, clicking on a bomb bubble can reduce the lives of both the enemy and us.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092850/extras/b30419b30ffc1840b43f2cd37582beeb.avif?t=1762056866\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Royal Garden: Go to the Royal Garden and interact with the NPC Queen. The gameplay is similar to that of the NPC Grand Secretary in the Zhonghe Palace, with four interactive options: conversation, gift giving, challenge, and plot.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092850/extras/c302eef80dbdf237f79dc18c1c765961.avif?t=1762056866\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Qintianjian: Go to Qintianjian and trigger meteor shower recruitment gameplay. Each recruitment consumes a certain amount of money to obtain 10 treasures, which can cultivate concubines in the harem.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092850/extras/452a88ed1b65ceadc0407ffc8b6f7fb6.avif?t=1762056866\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. Harem: Go to the harem, cultivate the beautiful Yang Guifei, give Yang Guifei the treasures she needs, and Yang Guifei will offer you a dance. Different treasures correspond to different dance moves. Yang Guifei's upgrade can increase her internal assistance value, which can add a percentage of national luck and monetary benefits.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092850/extras/3f4d59e38b935f62df7829dc875e5534.avif?t=1762056866\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4092850?t=1762056866","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4092850?t=1762056866","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092850/28e512c89905413e8e9f917401211221ba602f3b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762056866","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092850/28e512c89905413e8e9f917401211221ba602f3b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762056866","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"Some scenes in the game include adult only content such as revealing clothing \uff0c sexual innuendos \uff0cFrequent Nudity and sexual acts"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092850/extras/6035746d58ca95fb99c05c21de8dde77.poster.avif?t=1762056866\" width=1170 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092850/extras/6035746d58ca95fb99c05c21de8dde77.webm?t=1762056866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092850/extras/6035746d58ca95fb99c05c21de8dde77.mp4?t=1762056866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_